STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT
COMMENT hello world: a fount of type
COMMENT
COMMENT The colophon says that no type was cast for the world, and at the time
COMMENT none had been. Every sort was borrowed from the reader's own case, which
COMMENT is why the coast has never looked quite the same on two machines.
COMMENT
COMMENT This is the type, cast afterwards. Twelve pixels to the body, as the
COMMENT colophon has it; eight to the set; nine above the line and three below,
COMMENT where only the comma and the semicolon go, the Commas being fastened to
COMMENT the bottom. Each line under BITMAP is one row of a sort, top to bottom,
COMMENT written as a number, which is how a machine holds a punch.
COMMENT
COMMENT There are twenty-five sorts and no more:
COMMENT
COMMENT     #   the Hash              ~   the Tilde Sea
COMMENT     o   Oland                 -   the Flats
COMMENT     :   the Colons            .   Full Stop Deep
COMMENT     *   the Asterisk Caps     +   the same, after dark
COMMENT     @   the At                !   an Exclamation, yours
COMMENT     ^   the Caret             ?   Elsewhere
COMMENT     %   the Percent           "   the Dittos
COMMENT     ' ` the Apostrophes       , ; the Commas
COMMENT
COMMENT and h, e, l, w, r and d, which with the o of Oland are enough to set the
COMMENT two words and nothing else; and the space, which printers count, it being
COMMENT the sort they use most. The space was the easiest to cut. It was also the
COMMENT only one that came out right the first time.
COMMENT
COMMENT There are no capitals. Nothing here has been proper enough to need one.
COMMENT There are no figures. The plus sign is the only arithmetic the planet
COMMENT does, and it does not write down the answer.
COMMENT
COMMENT To use it: most systems that still take bitmap type will take this file
COMMENT as it stands. Set anything in it but the two words and the world's own
COMMENT punctuation, and it will leave gaps where the rest of the language was.
COMMENT That is not a fault in the fount. That is the fount's opinion.
FONT -world-hello-medium-r-normal--12-120-75-75-c-80-iso10646-1
SIZE 12 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 8 12 0 -3
STARTPROPERTIES 12
FOUNDRY "world"
FAMILY_NAME "hello"
WEIGHT_NAME "medium"
SLANT "r"
SETWIDTH_NAME "normal"
PIXEL_SIZE 12
SPACING "c"
CHARSET_REGISTRY "iso10646"
CHARSET_ENCODING "1"
FONT_ASCENT 9
FONT_DESCENT 3
DEFAULT_CHAR 32
ENDPROPERTIES
